          "text": "{\"clauses\":[{\"name\":\"Parties\",\"start_line\":6,\"end_line\":8,\"head\":\"This Agreement is entered between RAYMOND M. GEE\",\"tail\":\"Georgia limited liability company (“Company”), on the other.\"},{\"name\":\"Effective Date\",\"start_line\":8,\"end_line\":8,\"head\":\"The effective date of the Agreement is the date it is last signed.\",\"tail\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"Delta Bluffs Definition\",\"start_line\":10,\"end_line\":11,\"head\":\"Whereas, in December 2011, Company purchased a parcel\",\"tail\":\"Carolina near Savannah, Georgia, known as “Delta Bluffs;”\"},{\"name\":\"Consulting Services\",\"start_line\":17,\"end_line\":19,\"head\":\"Whereas, Consultants assisted Company with due diligence and\",\"tail\":\"value for the sale of the property; and\"},{\"name\":\"Consultant Compensation\",\"start_line\":21,\"end_line\":22,\"head\":\"Whereas, Company agreed to compensate, as described in this Agreement, Consultants for their consulting services.\",\"tail\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"1, Definition\",\"start_line\":26,\"end_line\":27,\"head\":\"1, Definition. “Profit,” as used herein, is the\",\"tail\":\"to transactions regarding the property (i.e. donations, etc).\"},{\"name\":\"2.a. Profits from Sale\",\"start_line\":31,\"end_line\":32,\"head\":\"a. Profits from Sale. Upon sale of a\",\"tail\":\"twenty-percent (20%) of the Profits from the sale.\"},{\"name\":\"2.b. Profits from Tax Savings\",\"start_line\":34,\"end_line\":38,\"head\":\"b. Profits from Tax Savings. Company or its\",\"tail\":\"which is expected to occur in October 2016.\"},{\"name\":\"3. Integration\",\"start_line\":40,\"end_line\":42,\"head\":\"3. Integration. | This Agreement encompasses the entire\",\"tail\":\"understandings between the parties, whether oral or written,\"}]}",
